 incoming.","createdAt":"2026-07-06T12:20:36Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Markp1598M/cobra/issues/1#issuecomment-4892705690","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOTMIJhc8AAAABI7r41A","author":{"login":"dev-nana27"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/try\n\nI can fix the duplicate completion registration panic. The issue is in how persistent flags inherited from parent commands interact with the completion function registry. Will trace the completion resolution path in `commands.go` and add nil-safety and deduplication. I write production Go CLI tools with Cobra.<details><summary>Check if you're the only one trying 👇</summary><br/>You're the first one to try to solve this issue, go for it! 😉</details>","createdAt":"2026-07-06T15:14:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Markp1598M/cobra/issues/1#issuecomment-4894423252","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"createdAt":"2026-07-03T02:20:09Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDOTMIJhc8AAAACp7vXNA","name":"bounty","description":"","color":"ededed"},{"id":"LA_kwDOTMIJhc8AAAACp7vXNQ","name":"opire","description":"","color":"ededed"},{"id":"LA_kwDOTMIJhc8AAAACp7vXNg","name":"$10","description":"","color":"ededed"}],"state":"OPEN","title":"🎯 Fix panic on duplicate shell completion registration for inherited persistent flags","updatedAt":"2026-07-06T15:14:19Z","url":"https://github.com/Markp1598M/cobra/issues/1"}
